{%- comment -%}
  Product card — a line of text the merchant writes or binds.

  **One block for every fixed thing a card says.** It replaced two — a
  metafield-only caption line and a tax note that carried its own copy — which
  were the same element with different words, one of them with a jeweller's
  vocabulary built in.

  Three uses, all the same block:

    - a fact about the piece — connect the text to a product metafield with the
      dynamic-source button and it prints whatever that shop keeps there;
    - a separator — a `·` between two other blocks inside a `group`, which is
      how "White Gold · 1.5 ct" is composed rather than assembled in Liquid;
    - an aside beside the price.

  **The text is a dynamic source, not a metafield picker.** Shopify has no
  metafield setting type for a block schema; what it has is the dynamic-source
  connector on a `text` setting, and inside this static card it binds against
  `closest.product` — the same context every other block here reads.

  **Style and element are two settings, because they are two questions.** The
  style is a look, from Theme settings → Text styles, and all seven are offered
  here as they are everywhere; the element is what the thing *is* in the page's
  outline, which is an SEO decision. Naming a look "Heading 2" welds them
  together and implies that choosing a size chooses a tag — the mistake
  `blocks/heading.liquid` had already been fixed for, where "Small" gave the
  right look at the wrong level.

  Left alone the style is the card's own caption — the theme's micro size, its
  meta tracking, uppercase, ink at 72% — because `snippets/text-style.liquid`
  prints nothing for a style nobody chose and `.card__meta`'s rule stands. That
  is what makes the control additive rather than a migration.

  **The row is held whether or not there is a word in it.** `.card__meta`
  carries `min-height: 1.5em` and always has: it is what keeps a row of cards
  level when one piece has a caption and its neighbour does not, and why a block
  bound to a metafield some product lacks shows as an empty line rather than
  collapsing.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign value = block.settings.text | strip

  comment
    A guard rather than interpolating whatever is stored: an unknown value would
    print as a tag name and Liquid would happily emit `<foo>`. Same shape as the
    level guard on `blocks/title.liquid`.
  endcomment
  assign tags = 'span,p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6' | split: ','
  assign tag = 'span'
  if tags contains block.settings.element
    assign tag = block.settings.element
  endif
-%}

<{{ tag }}
  class="card__meta card__text"
  style="{% render 'text-style', style: block.settings.style, color: block.settings.color %}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>{{ value }}</{{ tag }}>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.product_card_text.name",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "t:blocks.product_card_text.text.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.product_card_text.text.info"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.text_header"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "style",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.text_style.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.text_style.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "inherit", "label": "t:blocks.all.inherit.label" },
        { "value": "display", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.display.header" },
        { "value": "title", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.title.header" },
        { "value": "subtitle", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.subtitle.header" },
        { "value": "lead", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.lead.header" },
        { "value": "body", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.body.header" },
        { "value": "small", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.small.header" },
        { "value": "caption", "label": "t:settings_schema.text_styles.caption.header" }
      ],
      "default": "inherit"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "element",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.text_element.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "span", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.span" },
        { "value": "p", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.p" },
        { "value": "h1", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h1" },
        { "value": "h2", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h2" },
        { "value": "h3", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h3" },
        { "value": "h4", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h4" },
        { "value": "h5", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h5" },
        { "value": "h6", "label": "t:blocks.all.text_element.h6" }
      ],
      "default": "span"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "color",
      "label": "t:blocks.all.text_color.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.all.text_color.info"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:blocks.product_card_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "text": "Text"
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
